Package: quake2
Version: 8.70
Section: games
Priority: optional
Architecture: arm64
Depends: libc6 (>= 2.34), libsdl2-2.0-0 (>= 2.0.12), libgl1, libegl1, hicolor-icon-theme
Maintainer: Juan Pablo Lozano <libredeb@gmail.com>
Description: Classic sci-fi first-person shooter (Yamagi Quake II)
 Quake II (1997) by id Software, running on Yamagi Quake II 8.70.
 OpenGL 1.4 renderer, 720x720 fullscreen and gamepad controls
 tuned for Raspberry Pi Zero 2 W and Hyperpixel 4.0 XP.
 .
 This package includes the engine, game library and the official
 Quake II demo 3.14 data (supported by Yamagi).
